en stabbed by a needle. Amidst her groaning, Ange uses all her strength to focus on her eyelids."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"openEyes","raw":"睁眼"},{"type":"background","value":"2022winter_ConfinementRoom","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...The long-awaited light floods into her eyes, and she sees a familiar transparent wall— "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"A Nyto dressed in tatters, like one of those abandoned Isomers, stands quietly beyond it, watching her. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"She has an air of unfamiliar familiarity about her, entirely out of place in this setting."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeDamage","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Koleda","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hello, I am Koleda. From now on, I will be in charge of your daily care."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeDamage","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What about that crazy Nyto from before?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Koleda","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Koleda","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"She has other work lined up for her."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Nyto averts her gaze a bit unnaturally. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Ange closes her bruised eyelids and a faint, mocking smile appears on her lips."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeDamage","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That's alright."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Koleda","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Koleda","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ange has lost track of time ever since she was imprisoned here. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"She doesn't know how long she's spent like this, her left arm behind her head, her right arm behind her waist, and suspended in mid-air. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Extended periods in a custom-made straitjacket and the heavy weights around her ankles have left her body feeling like a statue... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If the Nyto assigned to her from earlier hadn't routinely kicked and punched her, she might have lost all sense of feeling in her body."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Koleda","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_door_elecport","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Koleda","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Let me help you change your dressings."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Nyto called \"Koleda\" slowly enters the room and starts applying a cool medication to Ange's exposed wounds."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeDamage","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Koleda","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Koleda","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Amidst the stiff silence, Koleda finishes treating Ange's wounds with gentle hands."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Koleda","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"spea